## Port status of pumpkin-codegen/src/wit/mod.rs and its submodules: none of it is ported, and this file says why.
##
## Upstream's `wit::main()` writes two things, neither under pumpkin-data: `.wit` interface files into
## pumpkin-plugin-wit/v0.1, and pumpkin/src/plugin/loader/wasm/wasm_host/wit/v0_1/generated_packets.rs, which
## binds those interfaces to wasmtime for WASM plugins. Nothing here can consume either: this port has no WASM
## host and no component-model bindings (src/plugin_api/README.md and src/plugin_runtime/README.md describe that
## gap), so a .wit file written under src/plugin_api would be read by nothing and could not be tested. The packet
## mapping is Rust glue over wasmtime types and has no aowlmony meaning until such a host exists. The pinned tree's
## pumpkin-plugin-wit directory is also empty, so the hand-written .wit files these would sit beside are absent.
## src/plugin_api/eventdata.aowl documents the event records without them. Port this when a plugin transport is chosen.
##
## PARTIAL: pumpkin-codegen/src/wit/mod.rs - not ported: its driver writes .wit files and a wasmtime packet mapping that no WASM host here consumes
## PARTIAL: pumpkin-codegen/src/wit/utils.rs - not ported: helpers only for the WIT writers below
## PARTIAL: pumpkin-codegen/src/wit/particle.rs - not ported: writes particles.wit for WASM plugins, no consumer here
## PARTIAL: pumpkin-codegen/src/wit/sound.rs - not ported: writes sounds.wit for WASM plugins, no consumer here
## PARTIAL: pumpkin-codegen/src/wit/entity_type.rs - not ported: writes entity-types.wit for WASM plugins, no consumer here
## PARTIAL: pumpkin-codegen/src/wit/java_packet.rs - not ported: writes java-packets.wit for WASM plugins, no consumer here
## PARTIAL: pumpkin-codegen/src/wit/bedrock_packet.rs - not ported: writes bedrock-packets.wit for WASM plugins, no consumer here
## PARTIAL: pumpkin-codegen/src/wit/data_component.rs - not ported: writes data-components.wit for WASM plugins, no consumer here
## PARTIAL: pumpkin-codegen/src/wit/enchantment.rs - not ported: writes enchantments.wit for WASM plugins, no consumer here
## PARTIAL: pumpkin-codegen/src/wit/biome.rs - not ported: writes biomes.wit for WASM plugins, no consumer here
## PARTIAL: pumpkin-codegen/src/wit/packet_mapping.rs - the clientbound lowering (`MappingMode::Serialize`) is ported in gen_wit_packets.aowl; the serverbound `Deserialize`, `ToWit` and `Any` downcast modes are not

const UnportedFiles* = [
  "bedrock_packet.rs", "biome.rs", "data_component.rs", "enchantment.rs", "entity_type.rs", "java_packet.rs",
  "mod.rs", "packet_mapping.rs", "particle.rs", "sound.rs", "utils.rs"
]
  ## Every file under upstream's wit/, for gen_wittest.aowl to hold against the pinned tree.
